senses.gloss:
--is to look on the useful and the useless equally; renunciation from affection, desire and difficulty; giving up of all Karmas and having an equal eye on good and evil;
1: वा. ५९. ५३.
result of ज्ञान or knowledge; gives the result of Karma, but difficult to achieve;
2: Br. IV. 3. ४५.
leads to वैराग्य.
3: वा. १०२. ६६.
